efer OS- or library-provided cryptography implementations.","markdown":"Do not use MD5, and always prefer OS- or library-provided cryptography implementations. Visit [https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS109733.md](https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS109733.md) for additional guidance on this issue."},"shortDescription":{"text":"An implementation of a weak/broken hash function was found in source code."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"helpUri":"https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS109733.md","properties":{"precision":"medium","problem.severity":"error","DevSkimSeverity":"Critical","DevSkimConfidence":"Medium"}},{"id":"DS440016","name":"GenericHardcodedSsltlsProtocol","fullDescription":{"text":"Generic: Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol: Generic: Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol"},"help":{"text":"Review to ensure that a TLS protocol agility is maintained.","markdown":"Review to ensure that a TLS protocol agility is maintained. Visit [https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440001.md](https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440001.md) for additional guidance on this issue."},"shortDescription":{"text":"Generic: Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"helpUri":"https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440001.md","properties":{"precision":"high","problem.severity":"recommendation","DevSkimSeverity":"ManualReview","DevSkimConfidence":"High"}},{"id":"DS106863","name":"DoNotUseTheDesSymmetricBlockCipher","fullDescription":{"text":"Do not use the DES symmetric block cipher.: The DES cipher was found, which is widely considered to be broken."},"help":{"text":"Use AES instead.","markdown":"Use AES instead. Visit [https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS106864.md](https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS106864.md) for additional guidance on this issue."},"shortDescription":{"text":"The DES cipher was found, which is widely considered to be broken."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"helpUri":"https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS106864.md","properties":{"precision":"medium","problem.severity":"error","DevSkimSeverity":"Critical","DevSkimConfidence":"Medium"}},{"id":"DS162092","name":"DoNotLeaveDebugCodeInProduction","fullDescription":{"text":"Do not leave debug code in production: Accessing localhost could indicate debug code, or could hinder scaling."},"help":{"text":"Accessing localhost could indicate debug code, or could hinder scaling.","markdown":"Visit [https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS162092.md](https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS162092.md) for additional guidance on this issue."},"shortDescription":{"text":"Accessing localhost could indicate debug code, or could hinder scaling."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"helpUri":"https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS162092.md","properties":{"precision":"high","problem.severity":"recommendation","DevSkimSeverity":"ManualReview","DevSkimConfidence":"High"}},{"id":"DS112844","name":"NodeHardcodedSsltlsProtocol","fullDescription":{"text":"Node - Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol: Node - Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol"},"help":{"text":"Review to ensure that a TLS protocol agility is maintained.","markdown":"Review to ensure that a TLS protocol agility is maintained. Visit [https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440000.md](https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440000.md) for additional guidance on this issue."},"shortDescription":{"text":"Node - Hard-coded SSL/TLS Protocol"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"helpUri":"https://github.com/Microsoft/DevSkim/blob/main/guidance/DS440000.md","properties":{"precision":"high","problem.severity":"recommendation","DevSkimSeverity":"ManualReview","DevSkimConfidence":"High"}},{"id":"DS425020","name":"DoNotDeserializeUntrustedData","fu